@startuml
title Sequence Diagram: Reporting a Lost Item

autonumber
actor "Student Loser" as Student
participant "ReportLostPage" as UI
participant "Storage Service" as Storage
participant "Supabase Storage\n('item-photos' bucket)" as Bucket
participant "PostgreSQL DB\n(items table)" as DB

Student -> UI: Fill title, category, description, last location, date lost
Student -> UI: (Optional) Attach reference photograph or invoice
UI -> UI: Validate form fields and file size

Student -> UI: Click "Publish Lost Item Notice"
UI -> DB: INSERT into items (title, category, report_type='lost', location, status='active', reported_by=auth.uid())
DB --> UI: Return created item record (UUID)

alt Reference Photo Provided
    UI -> Storage: uploadItemPhoto(file, item.id)
    Storage -> Bucket: Upload to item-photos bucket
    Bucket --> Storage: Public URL
    Storage --> UI: Return photo_url
    UI -> DB: UPDATE items SET photo_url = url WHERE id = item.id
    DB --> UI: Confirmed
end

UI -> Student: Display success message & show notice in Dashboard / Browse

@enduml
